  "description": "WPF spreadsheet control built for 10M-row business datasets (.NET 8/9/10/11+ Windows, AnyCPU). Viewport DrawingVisual rendering, compiled dynamic row/column styles, multi-core parallel filtering/sorting/find, star-sizing columns, zero-overhead cell widgets (Button/ComboBox/DatePicker/CheckBox/ToggleSwitch/ProgressBar), auto-themed standard ContextMenu, viewport on-demand auto-merge & fluent 2D/multi-column computed cell merges (HorizontalFirst/VerticalFirst Grid + Sum/Subtract/Multiply/Divide/Compute), multilevel merged headers, frozen columns, 5M-row live CRUD & undo, high-density ColumnarSheetTable, and live summaries. 官方完整开源演示项目（含 10 万~千万行分页、全功能实时开关与源码）：https://github.com/hu-xiao-tian/LightExcel.StandardWpf | 问题反馈/联系邮箱: 2285161881@qq.com",
